   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How do I answer what's your biggest weakness without sounding fake?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.26,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Pick something real but not central to the job. Then show what you've done to get better at it.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.19,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Like what? Give me an example.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You could say you used to take on too much alone, so now you check in with your team earlier on big projects.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg1"
  },
  {
